  "html": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"23619\" class=\"elementor elementor-23619\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba241fa e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ba241fa\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d2597fd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d2597fd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ccd9e4b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ccd9e4b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f20f99f elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f20f99f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">how many keywords per page seo</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ecb8f1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ecb8f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e2034a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9e2034a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-327f2b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"327f2b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"240\"><strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"238\">How many keywords should you use on one page?</strong></p><p data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"240\">Use <strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"294\">1 main keyword + 5 to 10 related keywords</strong></p><p data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"310\">That’s enough.</p><p data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"414\">You don’t need 20 or 50 keywords.<br data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"348\" />Just focus on <strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"375\">one topic</strong>, and Google will understand your page.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65d1604 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"65d1604\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Are SEO Keywords?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fde556c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fde556c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"506\">SEO keywords are words people type in Google to search.</p><p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"520\">For example:</p><ul data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"634\"><li data-section-id=\"i2visk\" data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"556\">how many keywords per page SEO</li><li data-section-id=\"634fvo\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"591\">how many SEO keywords per page</li><li data-section-id=\"197u1m0\" data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"634\">how many keywords should I use for SEO</li></ul><p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"695\"> These keywords help Google know what your page is about.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bfef6ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bfef6ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How Many Keywords Per Page?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f5b52f elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9f5b52f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"763\">Let’s keep it very simple:</p><ul data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"894\"><li data-section-id=\"1ah8sjm\" data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"805\"><strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"785\">1 main keyword</strong> → your main topic</li><li data-section-id=\"1qi03ws\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"854\"><strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"836\">5 to 10 related keywords</strong> → similar words</li><li data-section-id=\"1aqwyol\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"894\">Extra related words → use naturally</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0656d06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0656d06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Example</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-620a362 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"620a362\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"968\">Main keyword:<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\" />&#8220;how many keywords per&#8221; page SEO</p><p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"987\">Other keywords:</p><ul data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1096\"><li data-section-id=\"634fvo\" data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1022\">how many SEO keywords per page</li><li data-section-id=\"135r1od\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1053\">how many keywords per page</li><li data-section-id=\"197u1m0\" data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1096\">how many keywords should I use for SEO</li></ul><p data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1145\">This helps your page rank for many searches.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3910552 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3910552\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Using Fewer Keywords Is Better</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ffda02c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ffda02c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-section-id=\"qqu2m\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1215\"><strong>1. Easy to Read</strong></p><p data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1257\">Too many keywords make content confusing.</p><p data-section-id=\"6lddr0\" data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1282\"><strong>2. Better Ranking</strong></p><p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1321\">Google understands your topic clearly.</p><p data-section-id=\"240pge\" data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1345\"><strong>3. Looks Natural</strong></p><p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1385\">Your content feels helpful, not forced.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e19fae elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0e19fae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How Many Keywords Can One Page Rank For?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42bcf10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"42bcf10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1500\">One page can rank for <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1500\">many keywords (even 50 or 100+)</strong></p><p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1538\">You don’t need to add every keyword.</p><p data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1617\">If your content is good, Google will automatically rank it for more searches.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be0c320 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"be0c320\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is Keyword Stuffing?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d44cc31 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d44cc31\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1719\">Keyword stuffing means using the same keyword again and again.</p><p data-section-id=\"rmwu1r\" data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1739\"><strong> Bad Example:</strong></p><p data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1786\">“SEO keywords SEO keywords best SEO keywords…”</p><p data-section-id=\"b5qpt8\" data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1809\"><strong>Why it is bad:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1884\"><li data-section-id=\"85hori\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1826\">Hard to read</li><li data-section-id=\"c7va9c\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1860\">Google may lower your ranking</li><li data-section-id=\"19a9hp0\" data-start=\"1861\" data-end=\"1884\">Users don’t like it</li></ul><p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"1912\"> Always write naturally.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f15b52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0f15b52\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How Many Keywords for Homepage?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-26bee17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"26bee17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1958\" data-end=\"1976\">For your homepage:</p><ul data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2038\"><li data-section-id=\"1bnf1wo\" data-start=\"1978\" data-end=\"2004\">Use <strong data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2002\">1 main keyword</strong></li><li data-section-id=\"1o8tj6u\" data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2038\">Use <strong data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2036\">3 to 5 extra keywords</strong></li></ul><p data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2084\"> Don’t try to rank everything on one page.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3477efb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3477efb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Where Should You Put Keywords?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-184b254 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"184b254\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2244\"><li data-section-id=\"1v7tfew\" data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2153\">Title → main keyword</li><li data-section-id=\"mdqv0\" data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2188\">First paragraph → main keyword</li><li data-section-id=\"vsoscv\" data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2218\">Headings → other keywords</li><li data-section-id=\"4c9bfl\" data-start=\"2219\" data-end=\"2244\">Content → natural use</li></ul><p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2270\"> Don’t force keywords.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f6c7e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0f6c7e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Choose the Right Keywords</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0dd75bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0dd75bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2359\">Follow these simple steps:</p><p data-section-id=\"wouc20\" data-start=\"2361\" data-end=\"2387\"><strong>1. Use Keyword Tools</strong></p><p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2439\">Use tools like Google Keyword Planner or SEO tools.</p><p data-section-id=\"19wmhne\" data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2469\"><strong>2. Check Search Volume</strong></p><p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2510\">Pick keywords that people are searching.</p><p data-section-id=\"1buu5fs\" data-start=\"2512\" data-end=\"2538\"><strong>3. Check Competition</strong></p><p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2602\">Choose keywords with <strong data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2579\">low competition</strong> if you are a beginner.</p><p data-section-id=\"1jddgyj\" data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2634\"><strong>4. Pick One Main Keyword</strong></p><p data-start=\"2635\" data-end=\"2673\">Focus on only one main topic per page.</p><p data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2705\"> This helps you rank faster.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-547c6d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"547c6d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is Keyword Density?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80acc4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"80acc4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2807\">Keyword density means how many times you use a keyword.</p><p data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2822\">Best rule:</p><ul data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2875\"><li data-section-id=\"1gtzwhh\" data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2875\">Use your main keyword <strong data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2875\">1–2 times per 100 words</strong></li></ul><p data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2897\"> Don’t overuse it.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52ea9e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"52ea9e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Real Example of Keyword Use</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-749cc74 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"749cc74\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-section-id=\"cgs0cv\" data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"310\"><strong>Topic: SEO Tools</strong></p><ul><li data-section-id=\"d4se9d\" data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"351\"><strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"331\">Main keyword: </strong><a href=\"https://freeserp.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">keyword free serp checker</a></li><li><strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"377\">Secondary keywords:</strong><br /><ul data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"483\"><li data-section-id=\"au27p\" data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"403\">SERP checker tool</li><li data-section-id=\"xiyuae\" data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"430\">keyword rank checker</li><li data-section-id=\"gm16o8\" data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"454\">SEO rank tracking</li><li data-section-id=\"kcpdmu\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"483\">Google ranking checker</li><li data-section-id=\"kcpdmu\" data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"483\">free serp checker</li></ul></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21f2638 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"21f2638\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"262\" src=\"/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-23-184615.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-23698\" alt=\"keyword free serp checker\" srcset=\"/uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-23-184615.png 949w, /uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-23-184615-300x98.png 300w, /uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-23-184615-768x252.png 768w, /uploads/2026/04/Screenshot-2026-04-23-184615-600x197.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" title=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2831a77 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2831a77\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"573\">A tool like <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"521\">Free SERP Checker</strong> helps users check their website rankings on Google.</p><p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"720\">Instead of repeating only “free serp checker,” the page also uses related keywords like “rank checker,” “SEO tracking,” and “SERP analysis tool.”</p><p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"813\">This helps Google understand the full topic and rank the page for many related searches.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b52cfd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b52cfd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Old SEO vs New SEO</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82331a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"82331a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"height: 249px;\" width=\"324\"><thead><tr><th>Old SEO</th><th>New SEO</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Use same keyword again and again</td><td>Focus on topic</td></tr><tr><td>Keyword stuffing</td><td>Natural writing</td></tr><tr><td>Only keywords matter</td><td>Content + meaning matter</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d035e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5d035e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Common Keyword Mistakes to Avoid</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-edd51e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"edd51e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3701\"><li data-section-id=\"1xay3ez\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3564\">Using too many keywords</li><li data-section-id=\"1ssc6fi\" data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3611\">Repeating the same keyword again and again</li><li data-section-id=\"1py7xl4\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3640\">Not using a main keyword</li><li data-section-id=\"1ecptkh\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3669\">Ignoring what users want</li><li data-section-id=\"1fflepx\" data-start=\"3670\" data-end=\"3701\">Copying content from others</li></ul><p data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3742\"> Avoid these mistakes to rank better.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-71b86ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"71b86ba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Final Conclusion</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f0291cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f0291cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4374\">Keep it simple:</p><ul data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4448\"><li data-section-id=\"114mhu3\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4394\">1 main keyword</li><li data-section-id=\"1jn8lpm\" data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4420\">5–10 related keywords</li><li data-section-id=\"zn264g\" data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4448\">Write clearly for users</li></ul><p data-start=\"4450\" data-end=\"4478\">Good content always wins.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b77cc8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9b77cc8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bonus Tip</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8264a45 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8264a45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4518\" data-end=\"4551\">Don’t put everything on one page.</p><p data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4579\"> Create more pages like:</p><ul data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4636\"><li data-section-id=\"1b5ikr6\" data-start=\"4581\" data-end=\"4607\"><a href=\"/keyword-research-strategy/#digital-marketing\">keyword research guide</a></li><li data-section-id=\"zhzsen\" data-start=\"4608\" data-end=\"4620\">SEO tips</li><li data-section-id=\"1tymfse\" data-s